/-!
# Prop 5.9's root stage on the glued space: the stopped representation of the image word

Packet PROVE-STAGED-REP (rulings R71 Part (3), R75, R78). The first piece of Proposition 5.9's alternating
construction (stage `0`, angle `+π/2`) is, given the counterflow revealed up to time `s`, the flow line read in the
counterflow chart `Ψ` and killed at its first contact with the counterflow hull: Proposition 4.9's killed image word,
with R57's junction weights `(jwL cL6 κ ρL; jwR cR6 κ ρR)` and far marks the two junctions (`Fin.last`). This file
produces, on the glued space of `Prop411Q.CfGlueAE` extended by the auxiliary Brownian factor, the stopped
representation `IsKilledStageRep` of that image word with respect to the stopped counterflow history (the past of the
root stage), from

* PROVE-GLUECOND7/10's word entrance `exists_isWordEntrance_of_filtW` (the law: a Brownian motion of the image word's
  filtration, which contains the stopped counterflow history at time `0`);
* PROVE-GLUECOND11's exit `ae_imgExit` (Aux. lemma 22: the image trace converges at the killing time, to a point of `ℍ`
  or to a real point left of the left junction) and **`notMem_H_of_tendsto_kTrace`** (the limit is not in `ℍ`: the
  flow line would end off the counterflow hull);
* **`exists_isGeneratingTrace_of_Icc`**: a trace generating every closed initial segment with a left limit at the
  killing time is a trace up to the killing time;
* the named deterministic input **`KilledArcSwallowStatement`** (Loewner swallowing at the first contact: when the
  killed trace converges to a real point beyond the last mark of one side, the driver and the marks have left limits
  and the driver meets that mark), and the strict order of the image start (hypothesis `hstr`, see the handoff).

**`exists_isKilledStageRep_img`** is the result; `isStageLawFarK_img_of_rep` records the consumer route.

Conditional helpers with distinct names; they replace no source theorem. R48: nothing here uses Theorem 1.2/1.3,
`Theorem12ParamStatement`, `Theorem13Statement` or any `*_of_param`.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false

noncomputable section

open MeasureTheory ProbabilityTheory Complex Set Filter Topology Metric
open QuantumZipper (H Hbar fwdHull fwdMap fwdMapInv)
open LQGMetric (DistOn)
open scoped NNReal ENNReal

universe u

namespace InteractingSLE.Sec5.CrossCond.StagedRep

open WangWu hiding ratPt exists_ratPt_dist_lt
open WangWu.ImgWord CrossCond.Word49 MartChar.RealFlow Prop49Exit LawUnique Cond44Ref Prop411Q
